('srd35_magic_decanter_of_endless_water','Decanter of endless water','magic_item',9000,9000,'If the stopper is removed from this ordinary-looking flask and a command word spoken, an amount of fresh or salt water pours out. Separate command words determine the type as well as the volume and velocity.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"9,000 gp","roll_result":"17","raw_table_row":["17","Decanter of endless water","9,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_necklace_of_adaptation','Necklace of adaptation','magic_item',9000,9000,'This necklace is a heavy chain with a platinum medallion. The magic of the necklace wraps the wearer in a shell of fresh air, making him immune to all harmful vapors and gases (such as cloudkill and stinking cloud effects, as well as inhaled poisons) and allowing him to breathe, even underwater or in a vacuum.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Medium Wondrous Items","market_price":"9,000 gp","roll_result":"18","raw_table_row":["18","Necklace of adaptation","9,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
